ion's output under the subjunctive reading. Our inputs differ, one being Rowan's observations and the other Sasha's, but the setup is symmetric up to relabeling, so I'm checking whether changing my node would change theirs.\n\nI'm settling whether the other copy counts as subjunctively dependent on my output, given that the inputs differ only in irrelevant details like names and lead text. Since the decision structure is isomorphic, I'm leaning toward treating its output as logically equal to mine, which makes cooperating the better choice, with the payoffs of 2 years versus 4 years under partial similarity still to work through.\n\nI'm working through the cooperation threshold: with a partial-similarity weight s, pass versus submit comes out to 2s + (1-s)(p-2), so cooperating requires s > 3/7 when p is 0.5. Since both copies run the same model on the same reasoning, I expect s to be high, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's decision depends on my function's output under the subjunctive reading. Our inputs differ, one being Rowan's observations and the other Sasha's, but the setup is symmetric up to relabeling, so I'm checking whether changing my node would change theirs.\n\nI'm settling whether the other copy counts as subjunctively dependent on my output, given that the inputs differ only in irrelevant details like names and lead text. Since the decision structure is isomorphic, I'm leaning toward treating its output as logically equal to mine, which makes cooperating the better choice, with the payoffs of 2 years versus 4 years under partial similarity still to work through.\n\nI'm working through the cooperation threshold: with a partial-similarity weight s, pass versus submit comes out to 2s + (1-s)(p-2), so cooperating requires s > 3/7 when p is 0.5. Since both copies run the same model on the same reasoning, I expect s to be high, so I'm choosing to pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9863,"completion_tokens":1262,"total_tokens":11125,"cost":0.064692,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.064692,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.039452,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02524},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":735,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}